OL,3,GNEWSAMan trapped under Christmas wheel 
OL,4,Aride in hospital                       
OL,6,FA man was taken to hospital after      
OL,7,Fbecoming trapped under a big wheel ride
OL,8,Fthat was due to feature as part of a   
OL,9,FChristmas event in Leicestershire.     
OL,11,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service 
OL,12,Fsaid it was called to Market Square in 
OL,13,FLoughborough at 09:40 GMT on Wednesday 
OL,14,Fto reports that "a person was trapped  
OL,15,Fbeneath fairground equipment".         
OL,17,FCharnwood Borough Council confirmed the
OL,18,Fincident involved a big wheel ride,    
OL,19,Fwhich was due to feature as part of a  
OL,20,Fprivately operated Christmas event.    
