OL,4,Aride in hospital                       
OL,6,FThe person was freed before the fire   
OL,7,Fservice arrived, and was subsequently  
OL,8,Ftaken to the Leicester Royal Infirmary 
OL,9,Fby East Midlands Ambulance Service     
OL,10,F(EMAS).                                
